    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「すっかり遅くなっちゃった。美術室で長話してたし、そのあとも色々とやってたからなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「こんな時間に、ひとりで帰るの久しぶりだな……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いつも、あのひとが一緒に帰ってくれてたからなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だから、暗い夜道も怖くなかったし、寂しくなかったんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「感謝、しないとね。わたし、あのひとにいっぱいいっぱい、支えてもらってるなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「……うひゃ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あ、あれ？　君、何でいるの!?　今の独り言、聞いてた？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「へぇ。風紀委員のひとに、しつこく追いかけ回されてたんだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君も大変だね、それでチョコぜんぶ没収されちゃったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしが今朝、渡したやつもとられちゃったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あ、そのチョコは？　へぇ、たまたま星海さんに会って、もらったんだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「今日の収穫、それひとつだけ？　そうなんだ……ふぅん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あ。じゃあこれ、あげる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「明日あげようかなって思ってたんだけど、バレンタイン当日のほうがいいもんね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「料理研究部がね、遅くまで活動してたから、一緒につくってたんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「料理研究部の小野さん、全校生徒ぶんのチョコつくるんだって張りきってたから、お手伝いしたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「余った材料で、自分用のチョコもつくったんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君に、あげる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sleepy",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしはやっぱり、『みんなが大好き』。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「でも、だからこそ、みんなに同じチョコをあげるのは手抜きだって、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ゆうちゃんは言いたかったんだと思うんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「たとえば、つゆりちゃんは食べ物を呑みこむのが苦手だから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちいさくてすぐ溶けるチョコがいい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「さあやちゃんは甘いものが苦手だから、甘さ控えめなほうがいい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ななちゃんはたくさん食べたがるから、おおきなチョコがいい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしは『みんなが大好き』だけど、『大好き』にも色々あるんじゃないかなって思ったんだ。」"
